<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Lam Soon (HK) shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Lam Soon (HK) shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of food processing group Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.01 to HK$1.26 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lam Soon (Hong Kong) engages in food processing and electronics trading.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
